---
// src/components/Faq.astro
---

<section id="faq" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10">
  <div class="text-center mb-8">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#EFECE4] border border-[#DDD7CB] text-[#6B655D] text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
      FAQ
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#24211E] tracking-tight">
      Frequently Asked Questions
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-3">
    <!-- FAQ 1 -->
    <details class="group rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E6E1D6] p-4 sm:p-5 transition-all [&_svg]:open:rotate-180">
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-[#24211E]">
        <span>How is Unklip completely free with no limits?</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#736B61] transition-transform duration-200" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
        </svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#736B61] leading-relaxed">
        Traditional background removers run on cloud GPU clusters that cost thousands of dollars per month. Unklip uses <strong class="text-[#24211E]">WebGPU</strong> to execute the neural network directly on your computer or phone’s GPU. Because there are no cloud inference costs, we offer full access with zero fees.
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- FAQ 2 -->
    <details class="group rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E6E1D6] p-4 sm:p-5 transition-all [&_svg]:open:rotate-180">
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-[#24211E]">
        <span>Are my images and photos private?</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#736B61] transition-transform duration-200" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
        </svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#736B61] leading-relaxed">
        <strong class="text-emerald-800">Yes, 100% private.</strong> Your images never leave your browser. They are processed entirely on-device and never saved to any database.
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- FAQ 3 -->
    <details class="group rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E6E1D6] p-4 sm:p-5 transition-all [&_svg]:open:rotate-180">
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-[#24211E]">
        <span>Why does remove.bg charge for high resolution while Unklip doesn’t?</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#736B61] transition-transform duration-200" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
        </svg>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#736B61] leading-relaxed">
        Remove.bg downsizes free images to 0.25 megapixels as part of their business model to sell credits. Unklip maintains your original resolution and combines the neural alpha matte directly with your native pixels.
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
